    <sect3 role="installation">
      <title>Instalação do Sphinxcontrib-jsmath</title>

    <para>
      
      <!-- PR #53 upstream with additional modifications for tests -->
Primeiro, corrija várias incompatibilidades com Sphinx-9.1 e pytest-9.0.2:
    </para>

<screen><userinput remap="pre">patch -Np1 -i ../sphinxcontrib-jsmath-&sc-jsmath-version;-sphinx9_fixes-1.patch</userinput></screen>

    <para> Construa o módulo: </para>

&build-wheel;

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem>:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>&install-wheel; sphinxcontrib-jsmath</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      A instalação pode ser testada com o seguinte comando:
    </para>

<!-- Not needed with the sphinx9 compatibility fixes patch.
    <para>

      the <command>sed ...</command> command is needed because of a change
      in <application>Sphinx</application> API for versions greater than
      5.0. Even with the fix though, one test in the
      <filename>tests/test_jsmath.py</filename> suite is known to fail:
      <filename>test_disabled_when_equations_not_found</filename>. One
      warning about upcoming changes in docutils is also printed.
    </para>
-->
<screen remap="test"><userinput>pytest</userinput></screen>



